<!-- @opening -->
<p class="story-lead">Linux checks pass and the shared code merges. The Apple framework then fails to link, leaving main unusable for iOS consumers. Split CI by what each host can prove, then decide which evidence must exist before a change crosses the merge boundary.</p>

