<!-- @after Common Pitfalls :: check -->
### Try the decision

<details><summary>Linux job is green. Is Apple framework linkage covered?</summary>

No. Require a compatible Apple host and consumer evidence for that promise.
</details>

<details><summary>A restore-key prefix exists. Is a cache hit certain?</summary>

No. Record the actual hit/miss and rebuild/download behaviour; fallback lookup is conditional.
</details>

<details><summary>A package manifest changed. Can release evidence stop at uploading a ZIP?</summary>

No. Verify its immutable version/URL/checksum and resolve and exercise a clean consumer.
</details>
